        "sid": "2KI 19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hayyu Hezekiani, akuma qonqo worra kaani d'agayeeni laalefate woya ufi tatarsaase, ch'arqi naqate, Mana AABBO Waaqa d'aqe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni Eliakimu, ka mana hayyuuti guddatifi Shebna ka tatabe hayyu t'aafufi qaalole gugurdole gara raaga Isaya, ilma Amozi, erge. Worrileeni ch'ufti woya ch'arqi naqate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "D'aamsi inni, Isayati hima jed'e kana: Arriti guyya gaargalati, ka nu gaargalchani nu ch'eersani, nu niiti d'au jirtu, ta ilme irre d'iibatuni d'abde fakaanna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hayyuuni Ashuru yayu namicha gudda hojattu isaa, Waaqa gudda arabsi jed'e erge. AABBO Waaqi kanke ha araba kana d'agaye worra isa arabsu kana gaargalchuti. Tanaafi atini amma worra keenna ka hafu Waaqa kad'ad'i.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isayaani d'aamsa hayyu Hezekia d'agaye jennaani, qonqo deebiseefi waan jed'e, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi waan jed'u, maro dubbi hojattu hayyu Ashuru, ta worri na arabse, tana jettani insodaatina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini hayyicha odu lafa isaati isa deebiftu d'ageesise, duuba achiti isa ijeesa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka worri Ashuru ammalle worra Israeli naasisu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namichi Ashuru guddaani kaani, aka hayyichi isaani Lakishi bahe dira Libna, ka d'aatu suni jiru, had'u jiru d'agaye, tanaafi inni achiti isa argu d'aqe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani qonqooni worra Ashuruti d'ufte waan jette, Duuli lafa Misiri ka hayyu Tirhakani ka worra Kushi iti abba, had'iisa keesani d'ufu jira. Hayyuuni Ashuru dubbi suni d'agaye jennaani qonqo gara hayyu Yuda, ka Hezekia jed'ani, erge ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waan jed'eeni, Waaqi isani d'ugeefattani, diri Yerusalemu harka hayyu Ashuru keesa inseenu jed'e isani insobini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waan hayyuuni Ashuru lafa inni balleesu fed'u ch'ufa tolchu ya d'ageetani. Isani mala keesani waan jalaa baatani seetani? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ababooti tiyya dira Gozanifa, ka Haranifa, ammalle ka Resefufa balleesite, worra Beth-Edeni ka lafa Telasari keesa keesa jiru hobaafte, waaqi worra tokoleeni worra baasu dad'abe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hayyooti Hamathi, ta Arpadi, ta Sefarvaimu, ta Henatifi ta Ivaleeni ama me?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekiani tatabe worra suni iraa fuud'e soome, Mana AABBO Waaqa d'aqe tatabe suni AABBO Waaqa dura kaye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.25.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bah 25.22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Waaqa kad'ate waan jed'e, Ee AABBO Waaqa, Waaqa Israeli, ka barch'uma kanke akheekha waan lubbu qaba ka koola gubbaa teetu, siuma ch'allaati lafafi gubba uume, ammalle lafafi nama ch'ufa fidda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama, Ee AABBO Waaqa, waan harkaa na qaba kana argi, araba Senakeribuni si Waaqa gudda arabsu kana ch'ufa d'agayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "D'uguma AABBO, hayyooti Ashuru yayu gosa heddu hobaafte lafa worrale balleesite ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waaqoota worrale ch'ufa gubde — waaqoota woma keesa injirre, ka nami mukhaafi d'akha boch'e harkaani mid'aafatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amma tana ee AABBO Waaqa keenna, harka worra Ashuru kana keesaa nu baasi, duuba akasiini gochiti lafa keesa jirtu ch'ufti, aka atini ch'allaani AABBO Waaqa beetu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Qonqo Isayaani hayyuuti d'aame",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani Isayaani, ilmi Amozi, qonqo gara Hezekia erge waan jed'e, AABBO Waaqi Israeli waan jed'u. Anini kad'acha atini waan Senakeribu hayyu Ashuru na kad'ate ya d'aagae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wonti isaa ka AABBO Waaqi dubbate tana: Ee Senakeribu, diri Yerusalemu si koble si goyeese si tufata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nama atini arabsite goyeesite kana eenu seeta? Nami atini tufate sunini anuma, Waaqa Israeli qulqullo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atini qonqo namaani ergite d'aadde waan nani jette, Anini gaari kiyyaani fit'e gaareeni Lebanoni ch'ufa kore dabsad'e. Ammalle anini yayu hind'eesa d'ed'eerafi mukeeni jajabdu ch'ufa ch'irad'e badda keesa lit'e fulla ch'ufa gahe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle anini yayu lafa nyaapa ch'ufa d'aqe eela qotad'e, bisaani keesaa d'uge, miili askarti tiyya yayu galaana Misiri gosse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atini aka anini waan suni ch'ufa herege si tolchisise ind'ageenne? Anini amma waan suni ch'ufa ya tolche guute. Nami irre atini dira jajabaani ch'ach'absite bulleesite sii kenne anuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri dira suni keesa tauleeni mudame sodaate. Worri suni buuyo diida yokhaani raafu mana gubbati baatu, ta qilleensi oowani ilaboru d'ufe balleesu fakaata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo anini waan kanke ch'ufa imbeekha, waan atini tolchitufi fulla atini deemtule. Ammalle aka atini dallante naati roqomtule anini imbeekha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini yayu dallansufi kiyyiba kanke suni d'agaye, tanaafi amma tana kiyyoofi lugama Siti kaye kara atini d'ufte kaani si deebisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani Isayaani waan hayyuuni jed'e, Waan kanati akheekha sii taha. Ganna kanafi ganna d'ufu, mid'aanuma ufumaani baha nyaata, ammo ganna sadeeso atini mid'aani fach'aafate murate, zabibu oobrate mid'aani isii nyaatta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri Yuda ka hafu akuma mukha hiddi isaa aka dansaa lafa keesa seene late mid'aani baasu taha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yerusalemufi gaara Sioni gubbati nami inuma hafa, wonti akanatiifi AABBO Waaqi waan suni tolchu male intau.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wonti hayyu Ashuru, ka AABBO Waaqi jed'e, tana: Inni dira kana seene t'iya tokole indarbatu. Askartini wonte qabdu tokoleeni dira suniti ind'iaatu, ammalle booliti qotani dira sunini marsani injirtu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni, ka dira inseenne, karuma d'ufe deebia. Nami dubbi tana jed'e ana AABBO Waaqa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini dira kana nyaapa iraa d'owe baasa, maro guddinna kiyyatifi ammalle maro kakhu ta anini hojattu tiyya Dauditi kakhad'eefi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Halkani suni malaikaani AABBO Waaqa fulla duuli Ashuru jiru d'at'e, askarti nama kuma d'ibbafi saddeetami shani hobaafte. Boriyyaate lafti bariinaani reefa ufuma ch'iisu argani! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani hayyuuni Ashuru ka Senakeribu jed'ani kaani, kae Ninawiti gale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guyya toko, ato inni mana waaqa isaa, ka Nisroki jed'ani keesa tae waaqa kad'atu, ilmaani isaa lama, Adramelekifi Sharezani goraade ufitini isaa ijeefte, lafa Araratiti baqatte. Duuba ilmi isaa, ka Esar-Hadoni jed'ani, fulla isa hayyu tahe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka hayyu Hezekiani fayya d'aba fayye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
